Cell[TextData[{
 "Computation with noncommutative field is ",
 StyleBox["experimental",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.93, 0.27, 0.27]],
 ". Infinite recursion, and many other problems can occur. Also only main \
algebraic operations are supported for MV over noncommutative \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]field\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] (which, of course, is \
not a field at all for algebras other that  Cl",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Null]", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", "2"}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "{}_{0,2}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6a17c0e7-c862-4c25-bf9e-2911a0c7c453"],
 ").  We stress that  tensor product of arbitrary two Clifford algebras in \
general is not a larger Clifford algebra.  In particular, if two or more one \
dimensional algebras (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Cl", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathrm{Cl}_{0,1}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9f80391d-1242-4bc3-9ff5-045b8117c1b9"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Cl", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
        RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathrm{Cl}_{1,0}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f91669e0-26a5-4060-94fd-15d6ffd32845"],
 ") appear in the decomposition of the algebra and the field, then the \
construction is not an ordinary Clifford algebra, but so called extended \
Clifford algebra. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968488771729706*^9, 3.968489018840035*^9}, {
  3.9684890595909157`*^9, 3.9684890800073767`*^9}, {3.9684891495288343`*^9, 
  3.968489709636408*^9}, {3.968720690224553*^9, 3.968720690731833*^9}, {
  3.968720730038213*^9, 3.968720754992845*^9}, {3.968720786357945*^9, 
  3.96872081993322*^9}, {3.971247572107534*^9, 3.971247655047896*^9}, {
  3.975808367549559*^9, 3.9758083904955597`*^9}},
 CellID->257399871,ExpressionUUID->"374e1564-1750-40fc-b7da-8fbae8e5670b"],

