Cell["\<\
Applying Activate expands all products that appear inside gaProductPairExpand \
ignoring \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Except\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] setting, since \
both gaProductPairExpand and heads inside \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Except\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] list were suppressed by using Inactive. \
